# v1.1.0

## Features


## Improvements
[improvement] Nearby listen stays off Windows Bluetooth pairing, so it no longer shows as Unknown next to a keyboard
[improvement] Fire tablets on the same Wi-Fi send over the LAN instead of waiting on a private hotspot
[improvement] If a tablet cannot host the private Wi-Fi, the other device hosts it and they still send

## Bug fixes
[bugfix] Nearby send over Bluetooth finishes on Fire, ColorOS, and HyperOS instead of hanging until it times out

